WEBVTT

00:11:59.908 --> 00:12:06.335
I had so many times,
in a very puffed-up ego way,

00:12:06.359 --> 00:12:08.394
rehearsed what I would say ...

00:12:08.418 --> 00:12:10.065
(Laughter)

00:12:10.089 --> 00:12:11.339
on the beach.

00:12:11.363 --> 00:12:14.303
When Bonnie thought the back
of my throat was swelling up,

00:12:14.327 --> 00:12:16.496
she brought the medical team
over to our boat

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:20.728
to say, "She's really beginning
to have trouble breathing;

00:12:20.752 --> 00:12:23.807
another 12, 24 hours
in the saltwater ..." --

00:12:23.831 --> 00:12:27.576
the whole thing -- I just thought,
in my hallucinatory moment,

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.986
that I heard the word "tracheotomy."